==Dialogue==
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{DIcon|Restaurant}} Burrata Bakery
:;(Opens [[shop]])
:{{DIcon}} Chat
::'''Giovanetta:''' Welcome to Burrata Bakery! Would you like to try the most authentic traditional flavors of Rinascita?
::{{DIcon}} I'd like to see the menu.
:::'''Giovanetta:''' Here you go! Here's today's menu. Let me know if there's anything you'd like.
:::'''Giovanetta:''' Of course! Every bite you take here is a taste of the century-old rich culinary heritage!
:::'''Giovanetta:''' Pizza's delicious, and the bread's hearty! However, we do get the occasional customers with sensitive teeth saying it's a bit too sturdy...
::{{DIcon}} Is it really authentic?
:::'''Giovanetta:''' Of course! Every bite you take here is a taste of the century-old rich culinary heritage!
:::'''Giovanetta:''' Pizza's delicious, and the bread's hearty! However, we do get the occasional customers with sensitive teeth saying it's a bit too sturdy...
::{{DIcon}} Do you know [[Margherita]]?
:::'''Giovanetta:''' Margherita is a childhood friend of mine. Despite her small stature, she's actually a culinary genius!
:::'''Giovanetta:''' I used to be upset about her willful alteration of traditional recipes, but then I realized, isn't it a chef's duty to create dishes that everyone loves?
::{{DIcon}} Chat.
:::'''Giovanetta:''' Nowadays, they even consider [[Trattoria Margherita]] a place for traditional local food, just like Burrata Bakery... Honestly, do these outsiders even understand?
:::'''Giovanetta:''' You've probably heard the saying, "Crownapple has no place on a pizza!"
:::'''Giovanetta:''' I'm probably a conservative if these people are considered radicals— I mean, they're radically conservative for me.
:::'''Giovanetta:''' "Nothing but cheese and gemberry sauce on our pizza!" That's the creed here!
::{{DIcon}} Thank you. I'm good now.
:::'''Giovanetta:''' Feel free to drop by anytime! Burrata Bakery is always ready with flavorful delights!
:{{DIcon|Exit}} Leave
{{Dialogue End}}
